OL,3,GNEWSA'Distressing for our daughter to
OL,4,Abe treated on adult ward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA health trust has been criticised for
OL,7,Fnot allowing a teenager with the mental
OL,8,Fage of four to be cared for on a
OL,9,Fchildren's ward ahead of a major
OL,10,Fmedical procedure.
OL,12,FThe parents of 18-year-old Regan Kelly
OL,13,Fsaid they had been given a written
OL,14,Fassurance that their daughter would be
OL,15,Faccommodated on the ward at Coleraine's
OL,16,FCauseway Hospital where she spent
OL,17,Fperiods of time over many years.
OL,19,FThe Northern Health Trust has
OL,20,Fapologised to Regan and her family "for
OL,21,Fthe distress, anxiety, and frustration
OL,22,Fcaused by their experience".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
