OL,3,GNEWSA'Distressing for our daughter to
OL,4,Abe treated on adult ward'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Kellys, from Ballymoney in County
OL,7,FAntrim, have called into question the
OL,8,Fcriteria used for deciding where a
OL,9,Fpatient like their daughter is cared
OL,10,Ffor.
